# Benchmark working directories: .rd5 tiles and a DeFlock dump, hundreds of
# megabytes, and exactly the place a real trip's data would end up. Matched by
# prefix because a second region often wants its own (bench-sf, bench-metro,
# ...) and one that slipped the pattern would commit somebody's travel. See
# CLAUDE.md §8.
bench/
bench-*/
